---
---
<section class="hiw" id="about">
  <div class="hiw-inner">
    <h2 class="section-title">How It Works &amp; Our Technology</h2>
    <p class="hiw-desc">
Our mission is to democratize music education and technology by developing advanced, 100% open-source artificial intelligence tools. We build innovative software, ranging from Optical Music Recognition (OMR) engines to interactive, AI-driven music theory assistants and practice tools for piano and drums. Because we believe that hardware limitations should never be a barrier to learning, our ultimate goal is to bridge the digital divide: we strive to provide the hosting and infrastructure necessary to make these computationally heavy, GPU-reliant models freely accessible to everyone, regardless of their personal computing power.
    </p>
    <div class="hiw-diagram" aria-label="Technology flow diagram">
      <div class="diagram-node node-primary">
        <div class="node-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" width="36" height="36">
            <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="18" fill="#1e3a5f" stroke="#4a9eff" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M13 26V14l7 6 7-6v12" stroke="#4a9eff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span>Open-source<br/>models & tools</span>
      </div>
      <div class="diagram-arrow">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 60 20" fill="none" width="60" height="20">
          <line x1="4" y1="10" x2="50" y2="10" stroke="#4a9eff" stroke-width="2"/>
          <path d="M46 5l8 5-8 5" stroke="#4a9eff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="diagram-node node-secondary">
        <div class="node-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" width="36" height="36">
            <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="18" fill="#1e3a1e" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <circle cx="20" cy="14" r="4" fill="#4ade80" opacity="0.8"/>
            <circle cx="13" cy="26" r="3.5" fill="#4ade80" opacity="0.6"/>
            <circle cx="27" cy="26" r="3.5" fill="#4ade80" opacity="0.6"/>
            <line x1="20" y1="18" x2="13" y2="22.5" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            <line x1="20" y1="18" x2="27" y2="22.5" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="1.2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span>Musicians<br/> & Developers</span>
      </div>
      <div class="diagram-arrow">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 60 20" fill="none" width="60" height="20">
          <line x1="4" y1="10" x2="50" y2="10" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="2"/>
          <path d="M46 5l8 5-8 5" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="diagram-node node-accent">
        <div class="node-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" width="36" height="36">
            <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="18" fill="#2a1a2a" stroke="#c084fc" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <rect x="11" y="13" width="18" height="14" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#c084fc" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M15 18h10M15 22h6" stroke="#c084fc" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span>Lessons <br/> & Creations</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hiw-feature-row">
      <div class="hiw-feature">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" width="44" height="44">
            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="22" fill="#0f1e3a" stroke="#4a9eff" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <circle cx="24" cy="17" r="5" fill="#4a9eff" opacity="0.8"/>
            <path d="M15 33c0-5 4-8 9-8s9 3 9 8" fill="#4a9eff" opacity="0.5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p>Accessible for<br/>everyone</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hiw-feature">
        <div class="feature-icon gear-wrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" width="44" height="44">
            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="22" fill="#1e2a1e" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M24 14a10 10 0 1 1 0 20 10 10 0 0 1 0-20zm0 6a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8z" fill="#4ade80" opacity="0.7"/>
            <path d="M24 10v4M24 34v4M10 24h4M34 24h4" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p>Open-source<br/>infrastructure</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hiw-feature">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" width="44" height="44">
            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="22" fill="#1e1a2e" stroke="#c084fc" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <rect x="14" y="15" width="20" height="16" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="#c084fc" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M18 20l4 3-4 3M24 26h6" stroke="#c084fc" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p>Cutting-edge AI<br/>technology</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hiw {
    background: 
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 50%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15) 0%, transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0f1a 0%, #020617 100%);
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .hiw-inner { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .hiw-desc {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }
  .hiw-diagram {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }
  .diagram-node {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    min-width: 100px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .diagram-arrow { display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .hiw-feature-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .hiw-feature {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .diagram-arrow { display: none; }
    .hiw-diagram { gap: 1rem; }
  }
</style>
